{"_id":"68a7360f8ec3d8323af13556","nodeId":"Km5LvcJpyntrW2iA8h5e3","roadmapSlug":"computer-science","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:54.940Z","description":"# Rabin-Karp's algorithm\n\nRabin-Karp algorithm is a string searching algorithm that uses hashing to find any one of a set of pattern strings in a text. For strings of average length `n`, it performs in `O(n+m)` time with `O(m)` space, where `m` is the length of the pattern. It is often used in bioinformatics to search for DNA patterns.","resources":[{"type":"course","title":"Rabin Karps Algorithm","url":"https://www.coursera.org/lecture/data-structures/rabin-karps-algorithm-c0Qkw","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c3f"},{"type":"course","title":"Optimization: Precomputation","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/data-structures/lecture/nYrc8/optimization-precomputation","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c40"},{"type":"course","title":"Optimization: Implementation and Analysis","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/data-structures/lecture/h4ZLc/optimization-implementation-and-analysis","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c41"},{"type":"video","title":"Lecture 9: Table Doubling, Karp-Rabin","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BRO7mVIFt08&list=PLUl4u3cNGP61Oq3tWYp6V_F-5jb5L2iHb&index=9","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c42"},{"type":"video","title":"Rolling Hashes, Amortized Analysis","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w6nuXg0BISo&list=PLUl4u3cNGP61Oq3tWYp6V_F-5jb5L2iHb&index=33","_id":"6a7f4a1dcb44947debcf3c43"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:21.077Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/computer-science/content/Km5LvcJpyntrW2iA8h5e3.md"}